---
kind: scene
id: mika.date
title: Mika — the dawn lap
on: slotStart
when: "run.route == 'mika' && run.day == 7 && run.slot == 'afterSchool'"
priority: 10
after: 'visited("common.festival")'
---

## The track

::bg{location="track" time="dusk"}
::music{playback="start" mood="romantic" volume="normal"}
::actor{character="mika" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@mika{code="0010" emotion="laughing"}: Doctor says walk, don't run. So we're walking. Fastest walk on the island, though. Keep up.
@mika{code="0020" emotion="fond"}: I did the relay. I lost the relay. And then I floated a lantern with you, so honestly? Good Saturday.

::date{with="mika" spot="track" resultKey="lap"}

<match subject="scene.date.lap.mood">
  <when is="perfect">
    @mika{code="0030" emotion="happy"}: Finish line! We tied. That means we both win, that's the rule, I made it up.
    ::use{component="cg" id="cgMikaFinish" instance="use-001"}
    ::set{run.aff.mika += 2}
  </when>
  <when is="sweet">
    @mika{code="0040" emotion="laughing"}: You walk like you're late for something. Stay late with me instead.
    ::set{run.aff.mika += 1}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @mika{code="0050" emotion="sad"}: Sorry. I keep looking at the track like it owes me something. Let's head back.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@narrator{code="0010" when="scene.date.lap.hearts >= 5"}: He holds your hand on the last bend, the one he usually sprints.
